{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950750/extras/5ea86a1c300b7190298d0e9d55898d9a.poster.avif?t=1757246425\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950750/extras/5ea86a1c300b7190298d0e9d55898d9a.webm?t=1757246425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Shallow Pond</strong>, you play as <i>Ripples</i>, a small diver setting out on a gentle but mysterious journey beyond the pond. Swim like a penguin, bounce through mossy ruins, and uncover a world full of strange creatures, hidden places, and quiet wonder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950750/extras/52bdad69362ec186f9ed0d92924affcb.poster.avif?t=1757246425\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950750/extras/52bdad69362ec186f9ed0d92924affcb.webm?t=1757246425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vivid, handcrafted levels where land and water blend seamlessly - mini-sandbox environments brimming with secrets to find, buttons to press, and areas to unlock. Glide through currents, leap across gaps, and combine movement skills for satisfying, precise platforming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you travel, you\u2019ll unlock water-powered abilities like the <strong>Water Dash</strong> and <strong>Water Stomp</strong>\u00a0- momentum-based tools that consume water and refill when you return to it. These playful powers let you break barriers, reach new places, activate pressure switches, and uncover long-forgotten treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950750/extras/3c42bad07ecf8f9086ad20b73e40851c.poster.avif?t=1757246425\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950750/extras/3c42bad07ecf8f9086ad20b73e40851c.webm?t=1757246425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>shells</strong>, <strong>water spirits</strong>, and other hidden curiosities along the way. Some open secret levels. Others help you customize Ripples with new looks. And all of them bring you closer to the quiet mystery at the heart of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside a strange companion, you\u2019ll drift through lush meadows, shimmering caves, and sun-dappled lakes - chasing a feeling, a memory, and maybe something you didn\u2019t know you were missing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950750/extras/1ec7c0a7c7cf3cc02f3e0030c9ff56bb.avif?t=1757246425\" width=600 height=79 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Vibrant World to Explore</strong><br>Juicy lakes, glowing caves, and sunlit fields - each with their own creatures, challenges, and secrets to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid, Playful Movement</strong><br>Jump, double jump, dive, dash, and stomp - then chain it all together for smooth, expressive traversal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Water Abilities</strong><br>Gain unique water-based moves like the Water Dash and Water Stomp, and use them to explore in new ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Sandbox Level Design</strong><br>Explorable levels full of levers, hidden routes, and puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find Secrets and Customize Ripples</strong><br>Collect shells and water spirits to unlock new looks and hidden stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey with Cozy Vibes and Gentle Mystery</strong><br>Travel with a strange companion across a world that feels both brand new and strangely familiar.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2950750?t=1757246425","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950750/17517f906b23d420898ee6cec2300b7852942172/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757246425","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950750/85faf58e390af43e0f870cafebb46358c38295b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757246425","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950750/85faf58e390af43e0f870cafebb46358c38295b0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757246425","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950750/extras/5ea86a1c300b7190298d0e9d55898d9a.poster.avif?t=1757246425\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950750/extras/5ea86a1c300b7190298d0e9d55898d9a.webm?t=1757246425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Shallow Pond</strong>, you play as <i>Ripples</i>, a small diver setting out on a gentle but mysterious journey beyond the pond. Swim like a p