ipples with new looks. And all of them bring you closer to the quiet mystery at the heart of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside a strange companion, you\u2019ll drift through lush meadows, shimmering caves, and sun-dappled lakes - chasing a feeling, a memory, and maybe something you didn\u2019t know you were missing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950750/extras/1ec7c0a7c7cf3cc02f3e0030c9ff56bb.avif?t=1757246425\" width=600 height=79 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Vibrant World to Explore</strong><br>Juicy lakes, glowing caves, and sunlit fields - each with their own creatures, challenges, and secrets to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid, Playful Movement</strong><br>Jump, double jump, dive, dash, and stomp - then chain it all together for smooth, expressive traversal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Water Abilities</strong><br>Gain unique water-based moves like the Water Dash and Water Stomp, and use them to explore in new ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Sandbox Level Design</strong><br>Explorable levels full of levers, hidden routes, and puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find Secrets and Customize Ripples</strong><br>Collect shells and water spirits to unlock new looks and hidden stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey with Cozy Vibes and Gentle Mystery</strong><br>Travel with a strange companion across a world that feels both brand new and strangely familiar.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Nimso"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/29507